    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The AGENT P OISON approach is evaluated on three types of LLM agents: Agent-Driver, ReAct-StrategyQA, and EHRAgent. The results show that AGENT P OISON achieves a high attack success rate with minimal impact on benign performance. The approach also demonstrates high transferability across different embedders and is resilient to perturbations in the trigger sequence.",
